## Isolation (hard rule)

This manuscript is its own world. For this session:

- Do **not** read files in sibling manuscript folders, even if a search or tool returns paths from outside this folder.
- Do **not** carry over characters, places, plot beats, terminology, idioms, or stylistic patterns from any other manuscript — including ones discussed in earlier sessions or other repos.
- Do **not** suggest cross-references to other books unless the user explicitly asks.
- Treat the parent folder and all sibling folders as not on disk for craft purposes.

See the repo root [CLAUDE.md](../CLAUDE.md) for the full repo-level statement of the rule.

## Folder map

- [overview.md](overview.md) — submission metadata (frontmatter) + premise, theme, audience, comparables
