- [characters/](characters/) — cast; see [characters/README.md](characters/README.md) for the index
- [places/](places/) — locations; see [places/README.md](places/README.md) for the index
- `compiled/` — generated on demand by the `compile-manuscript` shared skill; holds timestamped editor-handoff `.md` files. Not authored by hand.

